msgid ":ref:`platform_teensy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../frameworks/arduino.rst:78
msgid ""
"Teensy is a complete USB-based microcontroller development system, in a very "
"small footprint, capable of implementing many types of projects. All "
"programming is done via the USB port. No special programmer is needed, only "
"a standard USB cable and a PC or Macintosh with a USB port."
msgstr ""

