#: ../../../frameworks/arduino.rst:81
msgid ""
"MSP430 microcontrollers (MCUs) from Texas Instruments (TI) are 16-bit, RISC-"
"based, mixed-signal processors designed for ultra-low power. These MCUs "
"offer the lowest power consumption and the perfect mix of integrated "
"peripherals for thousands of applications."
msgstr ""

