msgstr ""

#: ../../../frameworks/arduino.rst:84
msgid ""
"Texas Instruments TM4C12x MCUs offer the industrys most popular ARM Cortex-"
"M4 core with scalable memory and package options, unparalleled connectivity "
"peripherals, advanced application functions, industry-leading analog "
"integration, and extensive software solutions."
msgstr ""

